\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Comprehensive architecture of the proposed Mamba-PFAN generator. The model decouples smoke removal into a high-frequency ConvNeXt-MBI stream and a global low-frequency 2D Selective State Space Model (2D-SSM) stream. The Four-Way Cross-Selective Scanning (4-Way CSS) mechanism propagates context bidirectionally across both horizontal and vertical axes with strictly linear $\mathcal  {O}(N)$ complexity, requiring only 387.9K parameters.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{3}{}{figure.1}{}}
